<cb/>
</div> <div n="3" type="jArticle"><dateline><hi rendition="#b">&#x25A1; Aus Nord&#x017F;avoyen,</hi> 7 Jun.</dateline> <p>Der Senat in Turin &#x017F;cheint<lb/>
